        <obo:IAO_0000119>From: Brucella Agar with 5% Sheep Blood, Hemin and Vitamin K1 (Becton-Dickinson Difco and BBL Manual of Microbiological Culture Media, 2nd edition):

Intended Use
Brucella Agar with 5% Sheep Blood, Hemin and Vitamin K1 is used for the isolation and cultivation of fastidious, obligately anaerobic microorganisms.</obo:IAO_0000119>
