        <obo:IAO_0000119>From: http://himedialabs.com/TD/M384.pdf

Zobell Marine Agar 2216

Zobell Marine Agar 2216 is recommended for cultivation, isolation and enumeration of heterotrophic marine bacteria.

Composition
Ingredients                               (Gms/Litre)
Peptic digest of animal tissue   5.000
Yeast extract                             1.000
Ferric citrate                             0.1000
Sodium chloride                       19.450
Magnesium chloride                 8.800
Sodium sulfate                         3.240
Calcium chloride                      1.800
Potassium chloride                  0.550
Sodium bicarbonate                0.160
Potassium bromide                 0.080
Strontium chloride                  0.034
Boric acid                                0.022
Sodium silicate                       0.004
Sodium fluorate                     0.0024
Ammonium nitrate                0.0016
Disodium phosphate              0.008

Final pH (25˚C) 7.6+/-0.2</obo:IAO_0000119>
