        <obo:definition>Filament with one trichome in the sheath, where the trichome is two cells in width.  Arises as a result of cell division occuring in two planes,one perpendicular to the axis of the trichome and one parallel to the axis of the trichome.</obo:definition>
        <obo:has_exact_synonym>bi-seriate</obo:has_exact_synonym>
        <obo:createdBy>Carrine Blank</obo:createdBy>
        <obo:has_exact_synonym>with 2 cells aside</obo:has_exact_synonym>
    </owl:Class>
    


