        <obo:IAO_0000119>From:Humphry DR, George, A, Black GW, Cumming&amp; s SP.  2001.  Flavobacterium frigidarium sp. nov., an aerobic, psychrophilic, xylanolytic and laminarinolytic bacterium from Antarctica.  IJSEM 51:1235-1243.

