        <obo:definition>Intracellular granule composed of elemental sulfur.</obo:definition>
        <obo:has_exact_synonym>sulfur globule</obo:has_exact_synonym>
        <obo:has_exact_synonym>sulphur granule</obo:has_exact_synonym>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>Wikipedia:Chromatiaceae

The Chromatiaceae are the main family of purple sulfur bacteria. Many members conduct an anoxygenic photosynthesis. They are distinguished from the Ectothiorhodospiraceae by producing sulfur globules and storing them within their cells.</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:has_exact_synonym>sulphur globule</obo:has_exact_synonym>
