        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="&obo;BFO_0000051"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="&obo;CHEBI_65318"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>Wikipedia:cyanophycin

Cyanophycin, or multi-L-arginyl-poly (L-aspartic acid), is a non-protein, non-ribosomally produced amino acid polymer composed of an aspartic acid backbone and arginine side groups.</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:createdBy>Carrine Blank</obo:createdBy>
        <obo:definition>Intracellular carbon and nitrogen storage granule composed of cyanophycin macromolecules.</obo:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


