        <obo:IAO_0000119>From: Mashimo PA, Yamamoto Y, Nakamura M &amp; Slots J.  1983.  Selective recovery of oral Capnocytophaga spp. with sheep blood agar containing bacitracin and polymyxin B.  J Clin Microbiol 17:187-91.

TBBP medium consists of 4% Trypticase soy agar (BBL Microbiology Systems, Coceysville, Md.), 5% sheep blood, 0.1 % yeast extract, 50 micrograms of bacitracin per mL, and 100 micrograms of polymyxin B per mL.</obo:IAO_0000119>
