        <obo:definition>Single-organism metabolic process, where the prokaryotic microorganism uses enzymes to synthesize a storage molecule (usually a polymer) inside the cell that is used to store carbon.</obo:definition>
        <obo:createdBy>Carrine Blank</obo:createdBy>
    </owl:Class>
    


