        <obo:createdBy>Carrine Blank</obo:createdBy>
        <obo:definition>A solution of trace elements (or trace metals), sometimes also having an organic chelator of metal ions (such as EDTA or nitrilotriacetic acid).  Used to support the growth of microorganisms.</obo:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


