EDTA·2Na	                         250.0    	 mg
ZnSO4·7H2O                         1095.0	 mg  	
FeSO4·7H2O	                         500.0    	 mg
MnSO4·xH2O	                         154.0    	 mg
CuSO4·5H2O	                         39.2    	 mg
Co(NO3)2·6H2O                        24.8    	 mg
Na2B4O7·10H2O                       17.7    	 mg
Distilled water	                         1.0    	 L
</obo:IAO_0000119>
