        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:definition>Defined organic solution comprised of a mixture of vitamins (used as enzyme co-factors) added in small amounts to microbiological culture medium.  Used to support the growth of microorganisms.</obo:definition>
        <obo:createdBy>Carrine Blank</obo:createdBy>
    </owl:Class>
    


