        <obo:definition>An assay used to identify or characterize a microorganism.  Is used to determine the biological process, quality, cellular component, molecular function, or a chemical entity that is associated with the particular microorganism.</obo:definition>
        <obo:createdBy>Carrine Blank</obo:createdBy>
    </owl:Class>
    


