        <obo:IAO_0000119>Wikipedia:piezophlie

Barotolerant microorganisms are able to grow or survive at high pressures, but can also grow and survive at atmospheric pressures.</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:definition>Pressure optimum quality, where some growth occurs at elevated pressures, but growth is fastest at atmospheric pressures.</obo:definition>
        <obo:has_exact_synonym>facultative barophile</obo:has_exact_synonym>
        <obo:has_exact_synonym>piezotolerant</obo:has_exact_synonym>
        <obo:createdBy>Carrine Blank</obo:createdBy>
        <obo:has_exact_synonym>facultatively barophilic</obo:has_exact_synonym>
    </owl:Class>
    


