        <obo:has_exact_synonym>fermentative</obo:has_exact_synonym>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>Wikipedia:fermentation

Fermentation is a metabolic process of microorganisms which converts a carbohydrate carbon and energy substrate into acids, gases, and/or alcohols.</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:has_exact_synonym>fermenting</obo:has_exact_synonym>
        <obo:has_exact_synonym>fermented</obo:has_exact_synonym>
        <obo:has_exact_synonym>fermentable</obo:has_exact_synonym>
        <obo:definition>A prokaryotic metabolic process where the carbon and energy sources are organic compounds.  Is an anaerobic process which does not require an electron transport system.</obo:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


