        <obo:IAO_0000119>From: http://cshprotocols.cshlp.org/content/2008/12/pdb.rec11558.full?text_only=true

SM Broth

Composition:

Reagent	Quantity (for 1 L)	Final concentration
Glucose	10 g	56 mM
KH2PO4	1.9 g	14 mM
K2HPO4	0.6 g	3.4 mM
NH4Cl	1 g	20 mM
Proteose peptone 2 ( Difco 212120)	10 g	1%
Yeast extract (Oxoid LP0021)	1 g	0.1%
Dissolve in 1 L of H2O. Adjust the pH to 6.0–6.4 with KOH.</obo:IAO_0000119>
