        <obo:IAO_0000119>From: https://www.sigmaaldrich.com/content/dam/sigma-aldrich/docs/Sigma/Datasheet/c0422dat.pdf

CMRL-1066
With L-Glutamine, Without Sodium Bicarbonate

Components g/L
L-Alanine 0.025
L-Arginine 0.05787
L-Aspartic Acid 0.03
L-Cysteine•HCl• H2O 0.26
L-Cystine 0.02
L-Glutamic Acid 0.075
L-Glutamine 0.1
Glycine 0.05
L-Histidine HCl• H2O 0.02
Trans-4-Hydroxy-L-Proline 0.01
L-Isoleucine 0.02
L-Leucine 0.06
L-Lysine•HCl 0.07
L-Methionine 0.015
L-Phenylalanine 0.025
L-Proline 0.04
L-Serine 0.025
