Cocarboxylase 0.001
2&apos;-Deoxyadenosine 0.01
2&apos;-Deoxyguanosine 0.01
2&apos;-Deoxycytidine•HCl 0.0116
Flavin Aadenine Dinucleotide•2Na 0.000106
Folic Acid 0.00001
myo-Inositol 0.00005
5-Methyldeoxycytidine 0.0001
beta-NAD 0.007
beta-NADP•Na 0.001
