Sodium bicarbonate is added during the preparation step and the pH is adjusted to 7.0 ± 0.3.</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:definition>A defined liquid microbiological culture medium containing glucose, a pH indicator, a mixture of amino acids, vitamins, co-factors, and organic micronutrients.  Used for tissue cell culture.</obo:definition>
