        <obo:IAO_0000119>From: Cato EP, Holdeman LV, &amp; Moore WEC.  1979.  Proposal of neotype strains for seven non-saccharolytic Bacteroides species.  IJSB 29(4):427-434.

Growth was stimulated by the addition of ca. 0.02% Tween 80 to the media.  </obo:IAO_0000119>
    </owl:Class>
    


