        <obo:IAO_0000119>From:  Kampfer P, Busse H-J, Longaric I, Rossello-Mora R, Galatis H, &amp; Lodders N.  2012.  Pseudarcicella hirudinis gen. nov., sp. nov., isolated from the skin of the medical leech Hirudo medicinalis.  IJSEM 62:2247-2251.

