        <obo:definition>A trace elements solution containing boric acid, manganese chloride, ferrous sulfate, sodium tartrate, copper chloride, zinc chloride, cobalt chloride, and sodium molybdate.</obo:definition>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>From: http://www.atcc.org/~/media/DF06C418BB3A44189AD1A3CEB59B8D6E.ashx

