Tryptone (BD 211705).........0.5 g
Yeast extract................0.5 g
Sodium acetate...............0.2 g
Beef extract.................0.2 g
Agar........................10.0 g
Distilled water..............1.0 L


Adjust medium for final pH 7.3 +/- 0.1. Autoclave at 121C for 15
minutes.

(For the broth the agar would be omitted).</obo:IAO_0000119>
