        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym> indoxylphosphate</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <obo:definition>An enzymatic assay which tests for the presence of phosphatases in a microorganism, using various chromogenic substrates.</obo:definition>
