Published online Jan 28, 2009. doi:  10.1186/1471-2229-9-14
PMCID: PMC2660907
Construction of 12 EST libraries and characterization of a 12,226 EST dataset for chicory (Cichorium intybus) root, leaves and nodules in the context of carbohydrate metabolism investigation
Nicolas Dauchot, Dominique Mingeot, Bénédicte Purnelle, Céline Muys, Bernard Watillon, Marc Boutry, and Pierre Van Cutsem.</obo:IAO_0000119>
