                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="&obo;CHEBI_90321"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:definition>Measures the presence of para-phenylalanine deaminase activity using the substrate 4-nitrophenylalanine.  Para-phenylalanine deaminase activity cleaves the compound releasing ammonia and 3-(4-nitrophenyl)propanoic acid (yellow to brown).

A positive reaction is yellow to brown; a negative reaction is colorless.</obo:definition>
        <obo:createdBy>Carrine Blank</obo:createdBy>
        <obo:has_exact_synonym>PPA</obo:has_exact_synonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>para-phenylalanine deaminase</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
    </owl:Class>
    


