        <obo:IAO_0000119>Dotson,S.B., Smith,C.E., Ling,C.S., Barry,G.F. and Kishore,G.M.  (1996)  Identification, characterization, and cloning of a phosphonate monoester hydrolase from Burkholderia caryophilli PG2982.  J. Biol. Chem. 271 (42), 25754-25761.</obo:IAO_0000119>
