        <obo:createdBy>Carrine Blank</obo:createdBy>
        <obo:definition>Biolog AN MicroPlate™ is designed to identify a very wide range of anaerobic bacteria.

Tests for the ability of a microorganism to utilize or oxidize compounds from a preselected panel of different carbon sources.  Tetrazolium voilet is used as a redox dye to colorimetrically indicate utilization of the carbon sources.

</obo:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


