        <rdfs:comment>A dilute, mineral-salts, liquid microbiological medium comprised of magnesium sulfate, sodium nitrate, calcium nitrate, ammonium chloride, sodium carbonate, ferric chloride, disodium EDTA, and micronutrients.  Used for the cultivation of autotrophic Cyanobacteria.</rdfs:comment>
