1023. MANNING MEDIUM

(NH4)2SO4 6.00 g
KCl 0.20 g
K2HPO4 0.20 g
MgSO4 x 7 H2O 1.00 g
Ca(NO3)2 0.02 g
Distilled water 1000.00 ml
Solution A:
FeSO4 x 7 H2O 33.40 g/l
Solution B:
Yeast extract 0.20 g/l
Solution A is separately autoclaved and added to the medium. The medium is supplemented with Solution B (yeast extract). Medium pH adjusted by 0.1 N H2SO4 to pH 2.5 - 2.7.

