        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://www.oxoid.com/uk/blue/prod_detail/prod_detail.asp?pr=LP0027&amp;c=uk&amp;lang=EN

LIVER DIGEST NEUTRALISED

Code: LP0027

A biologically standardised papaic digest of liver for use as a source of nutrients in microbiological culture media.

The digest is water soluble and compatible with other culture media ingredients and may be sterilised by filtration or autoclaving; thus it is suitable for use as an integral part of many culture media or as a valuable supplement. Being derived from liver this product contains relatively high levels of iron. The profile shows the characteristic even spread of peptides obtained from papaic digests.</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:createdBy>Carrine Blank</obo:createdBy>
        <obo:definition>Papaic digest of mammalian liver.</obo:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


