        <obo:definition>An organic rich, liquid medium containing mineral solution, potassium phosphate, trypticase peptone, yeast extract, volatile fatty acids, hemin, glycerol, resazurin, sodium carbonate, D-glucose, maltose, cellobiose, soluble starch, L-cysteine hydrochloride, and sodium sulfide.  Prepared under an atmosphere of carbon dioxide and nitrogen.  Used for the cultivation of rumen bacteria.</obo:definition>
