        <obo:definition>An organic-rich, liquid medium comprised of tryptone, casitone, glucose, and artificial seawater.</obo:definition>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://www.dsmz.de/microorganisms/medium/pdf/DSMZ_Medium1009.pdf

1009. TCG MEDIUM

Tryptone 3.0 g
Casitone 5.0 g
Glucose 4.0 g
Seawater (see below) 1000.0 ml

Artifical seawater (ASW, eg., Instant Ocean) = 32 g seasalt disolved in 1000 ml distilled water.

