        <obo:has_exact_synonym>MJ medium</obo:has_exact_synonym>
        <obo:definition>A minerals-salts, liquid medium containing sodium chloride, potassium phosphate, calcium chloride, magnesium sulfate, magnesium chloride, potassium chloride, ammonium chloride, ferrous ammonium sulfate, trace elements, sodium bicarbonate, sodium carbonate, and vitamins.  Prepared under an atmosphere of dinitrogen, carbon dioxide, and air (oxygen).</obo:definition>
