        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://www.dsmz.de/microorganisms/medium/pdf/DSMZ_Medium1012.pdf

1012. DN BROTH

Bacto Nutrient Broth (Difco 0003) 0.8 g
Casamino acids 0.5 g
Yeast extract 0.1 g
CaCl2 x 2 H2O 0.3 g
MgCl2 x 6 H2O 0.6 g
Distilled water 1000.0 ml

Dissolve ingredients except calcium and magnesium chloride and adjust pH of the medium to 7.2 with NaOH. After autoclaving add calcium and magnesium from sterile stock solutions.

