        <obo:definition>A defined inorganic chemical mixture made from a commercially available synthetic sea salt (Instant Ocean® sea salt).</obo:definition>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>From: Instant Ocean Synthetic Sea Salt MSDS 

AQUARIUM SYSTEMS INC -- INSTANT OCEAN SYNTHETIC SEA SALT -- 6810-00N009578
===================== Product Identification =====================
Product ID:INSTANT OCEAN SYNTHETIC SEA SALT
MSDS Date:11/17/1986
FSC:6810
NIIN:00N009578
MSDS Number: BCSTP
