        <obo:definition>An organic-rich, solid microbiological culture medium containing meat extract, peptone, agar, and urea.</obo:definition>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://www.dsmz.de/microorganisms/medium/pdf/DSMZ_Medium2.pdf

2. BACILLUS PASTEURII MEDIUM

To medium 1 add 20 g/l urea before autoclaving. Do not adjust pH; pH raises to about 8 due to heat degraded urea.
For sporulation enhancement add 10 mg/l MnSO4 x H2O.

© 2007 DSMZ GmbH - All rights reserved</obo:IAO_0000119>
