13. BACILLUS ACIDOCALDARIUS MEDIUM

Solution A:
Yeast extract 1.00g 
(NH4)2SO4 0.20g
MgSO4 x 7 H2O 0.50g
CaCl2 x 2 H2O 0.25g
KH2PO4 0.60g
Distilled water 500.00 ml
Adjust pH to 3.0 - 4.0.

Solution B:
Glucose 1.00g
Agar 20.00 g
Distilled water 500.00 ml

Sterilize solution A and B separately at 121˚C for 15 min. Cool to 50˚C combine.

© 2007 DSMZ GmbH - All rights reserved</obo:IAO_0000119>
