        <obo:definition>An organic-rich, liquid culture medium containing yeast extract, trypticase peptone, soy peptone, sodium acetate, sodium glutamate, thiamine hydrochloride, biotin, potassium phosphate, magnesium sulfate, and tris buffer.</obo:definition>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://www.dsmz.de/microorganisms/medium/pdf/DSMZ_Medium34.pdf

34. CARYOPHANON LATUM MEDIUM

Yeast extract 2.00 g
Trypticase (BBL) 2.00 g
Soya peptone 2.00 g
Na-acetate 1.00 g
Na-glutamate 0.10 g
Thiamine-HCl x 2 H2O 0.20 mg
Biotin 0.05 mg
K2HPO4 1.00 g
MgSO4 x 7 H2O 0.27 g
Tris/HCl-buffer 10mM, pH 7.8 1000.00 ml

Adjust pH to 7.8.

© 2007 DSMZ GmbH - All rights reserved</obo:IAO_0000119>
