48. TRYPTONE THIOGLYCOLATE MEDIUM

K2HPO4 5.450 g
KH2PO4 1.200 g
MgSO4 x 7 H2O 0.025 g
CaCl2 x 2 H2O 0.015 g
FeSO4 x 7 H2O 0.010 g
MnCl2 x 4 H2O 2.000 mg
