51. SPHAEROTILUS MEDIUM

Beef extract (Lab Lemco, Oxoid) 5.0 g
Agar (if necessary) 15.0 g
Distilled water 1000.0 ml

Adjust pH to 7.0.

Prepare sterile agar slants by autoclaving. Cool the slants in a sloping position. Cover solid slants with 2 ml sterile tap water. Inoculate into the covering tap water and incubate at 20 to 25˚C for at least 48 h.

© 2007 DSMZ GmbH - All rights reserved</obo:IAO_0000119>
