571 Thermoanaerobacterium thermosaccharolyticum DSM 571
572 Thermoanaerobacterium thermosaccharolyticum
573 Thermoanaerobacterium thermosaccharolyticum
869 Thermoanaerobacterium thermosaccharolyticum</obo:IAO_0000232>
    </owl:Class>
    


