        <obo:definition>Similar to DSMZ Medium 71, except that thiosulfate is omitted and potassium tetrathionate added.</obo:definition>
        <obo:IAO_0000232>DSM 585 is Acidithiobacillus ferrooxidans.  Straininfo.net claims that no sequences found for this strain.  Strain not in TaxBrowser.</obo:IAO_0000232>
    </owl:Class>
    


