68. THIOBACILLUS NEAPOLITANUS MEDIUM

KH2PO4 4.0 g
K2HPO4 4.0 g
MgSO4 x 7 H2O 0.8 g
NH4Cl 0.4 g
Trace element solution (see medium 69) 5.0 ml
Na2S2O3 x 5 H2O 10.0 g
Bromocresol purple (saturated aqueous solution) 0.5 ml
Distilled water 1000.0 ml

Adjust pH to 6.6 - 7.0.
Sterilize Na2S2O3 separately in 100 ml of distilled water. For agar medium use 1.5% Difco Bacto Agar.

