        <obo:definition>A vitamin solution comprised of pyridoxine hydrochloride, thiamine hydrochloride, riboflavin, nicotinic acid, calcium pantothenate, biotin, folic acid, p-aminobenzoic acid(4-aminobenzoic acid), and vitamin B12 (cobalamin).  Prepared under an atmosphere of dihydrogen and carbon dioxide.</obo:definition>
