        <obo:IAO_0000232>DSM strains:
9485 Chloroflexus aggregans DSM 9485
9486 Chloroflexus aggregans
13941 Roseiflexus castenholz DSM 13941</obo:IAO_0000232>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://www.dsmz.de/microorganisms/medium/pdf/DSMZ_Medium87a.pdf

87a. CHLOROFLEXUS AGGREGANS MEDIUM

To medium 87 add 1.0 ml/litre sterile vitamin solution CA.

Vitamin solution CA
Distilled water 100.0 ml
Nicotinic acid 100.0 mg
Thiamine-HCl x 2 H2O 100.0 mg
Biotin 5.0 mg
p-Aminobenzoic acid 50.0 mg
Vitamin B12 1.0 mg
Ca-pantothenate 50.0 mg
Pyridoxine-HCl 50.0 mg
Folic acid 50.0 mg
Na3-EDTA 200.0 mg

Adjust pH to 7.5. The solution is filter-sterilized.

© 2007 DSMZ GmbH - All rights reserved</obo:IAO_0000119>
