        <obo:definition>An organic-rich, liquid culture medium comprised of ammonium sulfate, potassium phosphate, magnesium sulfate, calcium chloride, ferric chloride, manganese chloride, sodium tetraborate, zinc sulfate, vanadyl sulfate, cobalt sulfate, and yeast extract.</obo:definition>
        <obo:createdBy>Carrine Blank</obo:createdBy>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://www.dsmz.de/microorganisms/medium/pdf/DSMZ_Medium88.pdf

