        <obo:definition>A minerals-salts, liquid culture medium comprised sodium chloride, ammonium sulfate, magnesium sulfate, calcium chloride, trace elements, bromothymol blue, potassium phosphate, sodium thiosulfate, and cobalamin.  Medium has midly reducing redox if prepared under dinitrogen and carbon dioxide.</obo:definition>
