        <obo:definition>An organic-rich, liquid culture medium comprised of potassium chloride, manganese chloride, magnesium sulfate, ammonium chloride, calcium chloride, potassium phosphate, sodium chloride, trace elements, ferrous ammonium sulfate, ammonium acetate, yeast extract, trypticase peptone, resazurin, sodium bicarbonate, trimethylammonium chloride, vitamins, L-cysteine hydrochloride, and sodium sulfide.  Prepared under an atmosphere of dinitrogen and carbon dioxide.</obo:definition>
