129. POTATO DEXTROSE AGAR

Infusion from potatoes (see below) 1000.0 ml
Glucose 20.0 g
Agar 15.0 g

Potato infusion:
Boil 200 g scrubbed and sliced potatoes in 1000 ml water for 1 hour. Pass through fine sieve. Avoid new potatoes.

© 2007 DSMZ GmbH - All rights reserved</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:createdBy>Carrine Blank</obo:createdBy>
        <obo:definition>A water extract of potatoes (Solanum tuberosum), prepared by boiling then filtering the aqueous extract.</obo:definition>
