123. MARINE AGAR

To 1000 ml &quot;Synthetic sea water&quot; (see medium 79) add 5 g Bacto Peptone, 1 g Bacto Yeast extract, and 15 g agar. Alternatively medium 514 may be used.

© 2007 DSMZ GmbH - All rights reserved</obo:IAO_0000119>
