        <obo:definition>A minerals-salts, liquid culture medium comprised of potassium phosphate, ammonium chloride, magnesium sulfate, calcium chloride, sodium chloride, ferrous sulfate, trace elements, yeast extract, casitone, resazurin, sodium bicarbonate, vitamins, methanol, L-cysteine hydrochloride, and sodium sulfide.  Prepared under an atmosphere of dinitrogen and carbon dioxide.</obo:definition>
        <obo:IAO_0000232>DSM strains:
</obo:IAO_0000232>
        <obo:has_exact_synonym>Methanosarcina barkeri medium</obo:has_exact_synonym>
    </owl:Class>
    


