Casitone (Difco) 10.00 g
Resazurin 1.00 mg
Cysteine-HCl x H2O 0.50 g
NaHCO3 6.00 g
Distilled water 1000.00 ml

Adjust pH to 7.0. Gas atmosphere: 100% CO2.

