155. BEGGIATOA MEDIUM

CaSO4 (saturated solution) 20.000 ml
NH4Cl 0.450 mg
K2HPO4 0.100 mg
MgSO4 x 7 H2O 0.200 mg
Trace element solution (see below) 5.000 ml
Na-acetate 0.500 g
Nutrient broth (Difco) 0.500 g
Agar (if necessary) 10.000 g
Catalase, filter-sterilized 15000 – 35000 units/1000 ml
Distilled water 1000.000 ml

Adjust pH to 7.4 using pH indicator paper before autoclaving. The catalase is added just before inoculation.

Trace element solution:
EDTA 0.200 g
FeSO4 x 7 H2O 0.700 g
ZnSO4 x 7 H2O 0.010 g
MnSO4 x 4 H2O 0.002 g
CuSO4 x 5 H2O 5.000 μg
H3BO3 10.000 mg
Co(NO3)2 1.000 mg
Na2MoO4 x 2 H2O 1.000 mg
Distilled water 1000.000 ml

