Glucose 20.000 g
Distilled water 1000.000 ml
(freshly distilled)

Adjust pH to 1.0 with 1 N H2SO4. Stock solutions of yeast extract (10% w/v) and glucose (50% w/v) in water are sterilized separately by autoclaving and thereafter added to the sterile mineral salt medium.

