        <obo:definition>An organic-rich, solid culture medium containing casitone, yeast extract, cellobiose (or filter paper) and calcium chloride.</obo:definition>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://www.dsmz.de/microorganisms/medium/pdf/DSMZ_Medium160.pdf

160. CYTOPHAGA HUTCHINSONII MEDIUM

1. To medium 67 add 0.5% cellobiose (filter-sterilized)
or
2. Distribute medium 67 (without agar) in 5 ml amounts in test tubes, add a strip of filter paper (7 cm long) to each and autoclave, or place sterile pieces of filter paper on the surface of agarized medium 67.

© 2007 DSMZ GmbH - All rights reserved</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:createdBy>Carrine Blank</obo:createdBy>
