        <obo:IAO_0000232>Skim milk powder rehydrated at a 10% solution is pH 6.3 and Bacto Yeast Extract in solution is pH 6.3-7.3.  One cup contains 237 mL; 1 cup of skim milk contains 127 mg sodium and 407 mg potassium (=0.534g/237mL = 0.2% due to cations, assume 0.4% due to cations and anions).  </obo:IAO_0000232>
