        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://www.dsmz.de/microorganisms/medium/pdf/DSMZ_Medium171.pdf

171. ACETOGENIUM MEDIUM

K2HPO4 0.220 g
KH2PO4 0.220 g
NaH2PO4 x H2O 4.500 g
Na2HPO4 x 12 H2O 6.100 g
NH4Cl 0.310 g
(NH4)2SO4 0.220 g
NaCl 0.450 g
