FeSO4 x 7 H2O 0.002 g
Trace element solution (see medium 141) 10.000 ml
Resazurin 0.001 g
L-Cysteine-HCl x H2O 0.500 g
Na2S x 9 H2O 0.500 g
Distilled water 1000.000 ml

Adjust final pH to 6.5. Use 80% H2 + 20% CO2 mixture as gas atmosphere at one atmosphere overpressure.

© 2007 DSMZ GmbH - All rights reserved</obo:IAO_0000119>
