191. CORN MEAL AGAR

Blend 50.0 g corn meal in 800 ml of distilled water. Leave overnight in the refrigerator. Heat at 60˚C for one hour. Filter and make up volume to 1 l. Add 10.0 g agar and heat to dissolve, then autoclave.

