237. ENB MEDIUM

Nutrient Broth 8.0 g
Peptone 5.0 g
KH2PO4 1.5 g
K2HPO4 3.5 g
NaCl 5.0 g
Glucose 1.0 g
Agar 15.0 g
Distilled water 1000.0 ml

Adjust pH to 6.8 - 7.0. Sterilize glucose separately.

