232. MRS MEDIUM WITH CYSTEINE

Casein peptone, tryptic digest 10.00 g
Meat extract 10.00 g
Yeast extract 5.00 g
Glucose 20.00 g
Tween 80 1.00 g
K2HPO4 2.00 g
Na-acetate 5.00 g
(NH4)2 citrate 2.00 g
MgSO4 x 7 H2O 0.20 g
MnSO4 x H2O 0.05 g
Distilled water 1000.00 ml

Adjust pH to 6.2 - 6.5.

Add 0.05% cysteine-hydrochloride.

© 2012 DSMZ GmbH - All rights reserved</obo:IAO_0000119>
