230. TRYPTONE YEAST EXTRACT MINERAL MEDIUM

Tryptone 10.0 g
Yeast extract 10.0 g
K2HPO4 0.5 g
KH2PO4 0.5 g
NaCl 1.0 g
MgSO4 0.1 g
CaCl2 0.1 g
