        <obo:definition>An organic-rich, liquid culture medium comprised of potassium phosphate, urea, magnesium chloride, calcium chloride, ferrous sulfate, morpholinopropane sulfonic acid (MES), resazurin, yeast extract, L-cysteine hydrochloride, and cellobiose.  Prepared under an atmosphere of dinitrogen.</obo:definition>
