        <obo:definition>An organic-rich, solid culture medium comprised of ammonium sulfate, potassium phosphate, sodium chloride, magnesium sulfate, yeast extract, biotin, thiamine hydrochloride, manganese sulfate, methanol, and agar.</obo:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


