For DSM 6832 supplement medium with 10.00 ml/l of a vitamin solution (see medium
141) and replace 2,3-butanediol by 1.00 g/l of quinic acid added from a neutralized
anoxic stock solution.

For DSM 8385 supplement medium with 1.00 g/l yeast extract and replace
