</obo:IAO_0000232>
        <obo:definition>An organic-rich, liquid culture medium comprised of ammonium chloride, magnesium sulfate, calcium chloride, sodium chloride, ferrous sulfate, trace elements, selenite-tungstate, yeast extract, casitone, betaine, resazurin, potassium phosphate, sodium bicarbonate, vitamins, L-cysteine hydrochloride, and sodium sulfide.  Prepared under an atmosphere of dinitrogen and carbon dioxide.</obo:definition>
        <obo:createdBy>Carrine Blank</obo:createdBy>
    </owl:Class>
    


