        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://www.dsmz.de/microorganisms/medium/pdf/DSMZ_Medium310.pdf

310. V-8 JUICE AGAR

*V-8 Juice 200.0 ml
CaCO3 3.0 g
Agar 15.0 g

Fill up with distilled water to 1000.0 ml. Adjust pH to 7.2.

* May be replaced by tomato mash if not available.

© 2007 DSMZ GmbH - All rights reserved</obo:IAO_0000119>
