340. CAPNOCYTOPHAGA MEDIUM

Trypticase (BBL) 17.0 g
Yeast extract 3.0 g
Glucose 3.0 g
NaCl 3.0 g
KNO3 3.0 g
Haemin 3.0 mg
Distilled water 1000.0 ml

Adjust pH to 7.0.

Sterilize glucose separately. Incubate in oxygen-free, 5 - 10% CO2 containing atmosphere.

