        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://www.dsmz.de/microorganisms/medium/pdf/DSMZ_Medium357.pdf

357. FLEXIBACTER CANADENSIS MEDIUM

MgSO4 x 7 H2O 0.1 g
KNO3 0.1 g
CaCl2 x 2 H2O 0.1 g
Na-glycerophosphate 0.1 g
Trace elements SL-10 (see medium 320) 1.0 ml
Tris 1.0 g
Thiamine-HCl x 2 H2O 1.0 mg
Casamino acids 1.0 g
Glucose (sterilized separately) 1.0 g
Vitamin B12 1.0 μg
Agar 10.0 g
Distilled water 1000.0 ml

Adjust pH to 7.5.

© 2007 DSMZ GmbH - All rights reserved</obo:IAO_0000119>
