        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://www.dsmz.de/microorganisms/medium/pdf/DSMZ_Medium363.pdf

363. PHENYLOBACTERIUM MEDIUM

Antipyrine 1.00 g
KH2PO4 0.30 g
Na2HPO4 x 12 H2O 0.70 g
(NH4)2HPO4 0.70 g
NH4H2PO4 0.30 g
(NH4)2SO4 0.10 g
CaCl2 x 6 H2O 0.05 g
MgSO4 x 7 H2O 0.25 g
H3BO3 0.50 mg
CuSO4 x 5 H2O 0.04 mg
KI 0.10 mg
FeCl3 x 6 H2O 0.20 mg
MnSO4 x 4 H2O 0.40 mg
ZnSO4 x 7 H2O 0.40 mg
(NH4)2MoO4 0.20 mg
Biotin 0.10 mg
Vitamin B12 0.03 mg
Distilled water 1000.00 ml

For DSM 2118, replace antipyrin by 1 g/l L-phenylalanine.

© 2007 DSMZ GmbH - All rights reserved</obo:IAO_0000119>
