prepared under N2 gas.

For DSM 15286 and DSM 21156 supplement medium with 1.00 ml/l seven vitamins
solution (see medium 503) added to the autoclaved medium from an anoxic stock solution
sterilized by filtration. Adjust pH of medium to 6.5 – 6.7 prior to inoculation.

