        <obo:has_exact_synonym>Desulfovibrio sulfodismutans medium</obo:has_exact_synonym>
        <obo:definition>A minerals-salts, liquid culture medium comprised of potassium phosphate, ammonium chloride, sodium chloride, magnesium chloride, potassium chloride, calcium chloride, trace elements, sodium bicarbonate, sodium acetate, vitamins, sodium sulfide, and sodium pyrosulfite (sodium disulfite).  Prepared under an atmosphere of dinitrogen and carbon dioxide.</obo:definition>
