For DSM 13380:
Yeast extract 1.00 g
Na2S2O3 x 5 H2O 1.00 g
Adjust pH of completed medium to 7.0.

For DSM 13514:
Trypticase peptone 0.50 g
Yeast extract 0.20 g
Na2S2O3 x 5 H2O 2.00 g
Adjust pH of completed medium to 6.8.

