        <obo:definition>A minerals-salts, liquid culture medium comprised of ammonium chloride, potassium phosphate, potassium chloride, calcium chloride, magnesium chloride, sodium chloride, trace elements, resazurin, elemental sulfur, sodium bicarbonate, vitamins, and sodium sulfide.  Prepared under an atmosphere of dinitrogen, dihydrogen, and carbon dioxide.</obo:definition>
