        <obo:createdBy>Carrine Blank</obo:createdBy>
        <obo:IAO_0000232>DSM strains:
</obo:IAO_0000232>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://www.dsmz.de/microorganisms/medium/pdf/DSMZ_Medium429d.pdf


429d. FRANCISELLA HALIOTICIDA MEDIUM

Dissolve Columbia agar base in 70% artificial seawater and add additional 2 g agar per liter. Autoclave and mix solution with 4% horse or sheep blood after cooling to 50˚C. Add 1% glucose, 2 mM FeCl3 and 0.1% cysteine, mix well and pour plates. Rehydrate pellets of freeze-dried ampoules in liquid medium 220 or 215.


© 2010 DSMZ GmbH - All rights reserved</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:has_exact_synonym>Francisella halioticida medium</obo:has_exact_synonym>
    </owl:Class>
    


