        <obo:definition>An organic-rich, liquid culture medium comprised of potassium phosphate, ammonium chloride, magnesium chloride, calcium chloride, sodium bicarbonate, sodium chloride, trace elements, vitamins, sodium sulfide, sodium thiosulfate, and sodium malate.</obo:definition>
