NH4Cl 0.50 g
MgCl2 x 6 H2O 0.20 g
CaCl2 x 2 H2O 0.10 g
NaHCO3 3.00 g
NaCl 30.00 g
Trace element solution SLA* 1.00 ml
Vitamin solution VA* 1.00 ml
Na2S x 9 H2O 0.05 g
Na2S2O3 x 5 H2O 0.50 g
Na-malate 1.00 g
Distilled water 1000.00 ml

Adjust pH to 8.7, filter sterilize and add appropriate amount of Na2S solution.

* see medium 351

© 2007 DSMZ GmbH - All rights reserved</obo:IAO_0000119>
    </owl:Class>
    


