        <obo:IAO_0000119>Wikipedia:Oatmeal

Oatmeal is oat groats (i.e. grains) that have been ground, steel-cut, crushed, or rolled. Ground oats are also called &apos;white oats&apos;.

The term &apos;oatmeal&apos; is also used in the U.S. and parts of Canada to mean oat porridge.</obo:IAO_0000119>
