        <obo:IAO_0000232>DSM strains:
</obo:IAO_0000232>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://www.dsmz.de/microorganisms/medium/pdf/DSMZ_Medium465a.pdf

465a. MINERAL MEDIUM WITH 2-HYDROXYBIPHENYL

Prepare medium 465. Dissolve 2-hydroxybiphenyl in ethanol (50 g/l) and filter sterilize. Pipette a volume of this stock solution into a sterile culture vessel so that the final concentration of 2-hydroxybiphenyl will be 0.5 g/l medium. Let the ethanol evaporate under sterile conditions. Add medium 465.

