461c. MINERAL MEDIUM WITH O-NITROPHENOL

Dissolve 0.5 g o-nitrophenol per liter phosphate buffer (50 mM, pH 7.5) and sterilize by filtration. Prepare and autoclave medium 461 (vitamins not necessary). Add 200 ml nitrophenol solution to 800 ml medium 461.

