462. MINERAL MEDIUM (BRUNNER) WITH VITAMINS

Na2HPO4 2.44 g
KH2PO4 1.52 g
(NH4)2SO4 0.50 g
MgSO4 x 7 H2O 0.20 g
CaCl2 x 2 H2O 0.05 g
Trace element sol. SL-4 (see below) 10.00 ml
Vitamin solution (Schlegel, see below) 2.50 ml
Distilled water 1000.00 ml
Adjust pH to 6.9.

Rehydrate and cultivate lyophilized cells in the complex medium recommended for the specific strain (e.g. medium 1, 220 or 535). After this reactivation, cultivate in mineral medium 462 with the appropriate carbon source.

Trace element solution SL-4:
EDTA 0.50 g
FeSO4 x 7 H2O 0.20 g
Trace element solution SL-6 (see below) 100.00 ml
Distilled water 900.00 ml

Trace element solution SL-6:
ZnSO4 x 7 H2O 0.10 g
MnCl2 x 4 H2O 0.03 g
H3BO3 0.30 g
CoCl2 x 6 H2O 0.20 g
CuCl2 x 2 H2O 0.01 g
NiCl2 x 6 H2O 0.02 g
Na2MoO4 x 2 H2O 0.03 g
Distilled water 1000.00 ml

Vitamin solution:
p-Aminobenzoate 1.0 mg
Biotin 0.2 mg
Nicotinic acid 2.0 mg
Thiamine-HCl x 2 H2O 1.0 mg
Ca-pantothenate 0.5 mg
Pyridoxamine 5.0 mg
Vitamin B12 2.0 mg
Distilled water 100.0 ml

© 2010 DSMZ GmbH - All rights reserved</obo:IAO_0000119>
