461b. MINERAL MEDIUM WITH PYRROLIC ACID

Dissolve 10 mol pyrrole-2-carboxylic acid per liter potassium phosphate buffer (50 mM; pH 7.2) and sterilize the solution by membrane filtration. Prepare and autoclave medium 461 (vitamins not necessary). Add 10 ml of pyrrolic acid solution per liter mineral medium.

