K2HPO4 0.50 g
NH4Cl 1.00 g
MgSO4 x 7 H2O 0.02 g
Yeast extract 0.20 g
Casamino acids 0.10 g
Distilled water 900.00 ml
pH 7.4

Autoclave for 15 min. Add 1 ml of sterile SL-4 (see medium 14) and 100 ml of filter-sterilized phenol-solution (4.7g/l).

© 2007 DSMZ GmbH - All rights reserved</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:definition>An organic-rich, liquid culture medium comprised of potassium phosphate, ammonium chloride, magnesium sulfate, yeast extract, casamino acids, trace elements, and phenol.</obo:definition>
