Prepare medium 457. Make a stock solution of 4 g/l 3-chloroacrylic acid in water, neutralize and filter sterilize. Add 20 ml of this stock solution to 1 l of autoclaved medium. For better growth, 1 g/l glucose may be supplied additionally or instead of the chloroacrylic acid.

