Dissolve 78.3 g/l 2-chlorobenzoic acid in water by slow addition of concentrated NaOH (pH should reach 7.4). Filter-sterilize the solution and add 10.0 ml per liter autoclaved medium 457. Adjust the pH of the final medium to 7.4.

