454. EBA MEDIUM

KH2PO4 0.20 g
NaCl 1.00 g
KCl 0.50 g
MgSO4 x 7 H2O 0.50 g
CaCl2 x 2 H2O 0.15 g
NH4Cl 0.25 g
Trace element sol. SL-10 (see medium 320) 1.00 ml
Resazurin 1.00 mg
Na2SeO3 x 5 H2O 1.00 ml
(0.26 g/ 1000 ml 10 mM NaOH)
Glycine 2.00 g
Distilled water 950.00 ml
pH 7.2 to 7.4

Before inoculation add per 100 ml of medium:
Biotin (10 mg/l) 0.20 ml
(autoclave for 10 minutes under N2)
NaHCO3 (84 g/l) 3.00 ml
(autoclaved under CO2)
Na2S (60 g/l) 1.00 ml
(autoclaved under N2)

© 2007 DSMZ GmbH - All rights reserved</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:has_exact_synonym>EBA medium</obo:has_exact_synonym>
