        </owl:equivalentClass>
        <obo:definition>An L-arabinosidase assay for the activity of L-arabinofuranosidase in a microorganism using various chromogenic substrates which carries out the hydrolysis of terminal L-arabinofuranoside residues in alpha-L-arabinofuranosides.</obo:definition>
